				<h2>Aqua Leaf Farms and benefits of Hydroponics Farming</h2>
				<p>Introducing Aqua Leaf Farms, State of the Art AI and IoT enabled fully automated Hydroponic farm.</p>
				<p>
					We grow a variety of exotic leafy greens and vine crops hydroponically in our outdoor polyhouse based in
						  Thane. We have a variety of produce - Salad Boxes, Cherry Tomatoes, Lettuces, Kale, Swiss Chards, Indian
						  Greens, Bell Peppers, Jalapenos, etc
				</p>
				<p>
					Hydroponic produce is scientifically proven to be much more fresher and gives higher yield using 85% less
						  water. All our produce is 100% residue free that means, you can consume all our veggies raw and fresh with
						  out any worries of pesticides.
				</p>
				<p>
					We are happy to announce that we have started deliveries from our farm, so for a FRESHER, CRISPIER and
						  TASTIER experience, choose Aqua Leaf Farms
				</p>

				<h3>Key Benefits</h3>
				<ul class="inroBenf">
